<!-- 历史标签：当前分支的提交（单栏手风琴）。点击提交在原位展开正文、文件与逐文件 diff；只读。 -->
<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:arc="https://github.com/AIDotNet/TKCode.Arc"
             xmlns:lucide="https://github.com/AIDotNet/TKCode.Arc/lucide"
             xmlns:vm="using:TKCode.Desktop.ViewModels"
             xmlns:icons="using:TKCode.Desktop.Icons"
             xmlns:controls="using:TKCode.Desktop.Controls"
             xmlns:motion="using:TKCode.Desktop.Motion"
             xmlns:views="using:TKCode.Desktop.Views"
             xmlns:loc="using:TKCode.Desktop.Localization"
             x:Class="TKCode.Desktop.Views.HistoryTabView"
             x:DataType="vm:HistoryTabViewModel">
    <DockPanel>
        <!-- 顶部：仓库选择（多仓库时）、当前分支、刷新 -->
        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Top" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource TKCode.Divider}" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="12,4,8,4">
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*,Auto">
                <arc:Select ItemsSource="{Binding Repositories}" SelectedItem="{Binding SelectedRepository, Mode=TwoWay}"
                            Size="Small" MaxWidth="150" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            IsVisible="{Binding HasMultipleRepositories}" arc:Tooltip.Tip="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryRepository}" />
                <Grid Grid.Column="1" ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <icons:LucideIcon Kind="GitBranch" Width="13" Height="13" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                      StrokeBrush="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding BranchText}" Margin="6,0,0,0" FontSize="12"
                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                               MaxLines="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                </Grid>
                <Button Grid.Column="2" Theme="{StaticResource TKCode.RowButton}" Width="24" MinHeight="24" Padding="0"
                        HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" Command="{Binding RefreshCommand}"
                        arc:Tooltip.Tip="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryRefresh}"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryRefresh}">
                    <icons:LucideIcon Kind="RefreshCw" Width="13" Height="13"
                                      StrokeBrush="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                </Button>
            </Grid>
        </Border>

        <Panel>
            <arc:ScrollArea IsVisible="{Binding HasRepository}">
                <StackPanel Margin="8,6,8,12">
                    <!-- 读取失败的顶层提示：提交列表仍保留 -->
                    <arc:Alert Tone="Danger" Content="{Binding Error}" IsVisible="{Binding HasError}" Margin="0,0,0,6" />

                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" Margin="8,4,0,6" IsVisible="{Binding IsLoading}">
                        <controls:DotSpinner Width="11" Height="11" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                        <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryLoading}" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                    </StackPanel>

                    <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Commits}">
                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                            <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:GitCommitViewModel">
                                <StackPanel Margin="0,0,0,4">
                                    <Button Theme="{StaticResource TKCode.RowButton}" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch" Padding="6" Command="{Binding ToggleExpandedCommand}">
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*,Auto">
                                            <icons:LucideIcon Kind="ChevronRight" Width="12" Height="12" Margin="0,0,6,0"
                                                              VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                              StrokeBrush="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}"
                                                              motion:Turn.IsOn="{Binding IsExpanded}" />
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Spacing="2">
                                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Subject}" FontSize="13" MaxLines="1"
                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextPrimary}"
                                                               TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip.Tip="{Binding Subject}" />
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding DateText}" FontSize="11" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                                               VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}" />
                                                </Grid>
                                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding ShortSha}" FontSize="11"
                                                               FontFamily="{StaticResource TKCode.MonoFont}"
                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}" />
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Author}" FontSize="11" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                                               MaxLines="1" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}" />
                                                </Grid>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </Button>

                                    <!-- 展开区在按钮之外：整行按钮只负责展开 / 折叠 -->
                                    <StackPanel IsVisible="{Binding IsExpanded}" Margin="24,2,0,8" Spacing="6">
                                        <SelectableTextBlock Text="{Binding Message}" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                             Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryMergeFirstParent}" FontSize="11"
                                                   TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="{Binding IsMerge}"
                                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}" />

                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Sha}" FontSize="11" FontFamily="{StaticResource TKCode.MonoFont}"
                                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}"
                                                       TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                            <Button Grid.Column="1" Theme="{StaticResource TKCode.RowButton}" Width="22" MinHeight="22"
                                                    Padding="0" Margin="6,0,0,0" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                    Command="{Binding $parent[UserControl].((vm:HistoryTabViewModel)DataContext).CopyHashCommand}"
                                                    CommandParameter="{Binding Sha}"
                                                    arc:Tooltip.Tip="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryCopyHash}"
                                                    AutomationProperties.Name="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryCopyHash}">
                                                <icons:LucideIcon Kind="Copy" Width="12" Height="12"
                                                                  StrokeBrush="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                                            </Button>
                                        </Grid>

                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" IsVisible="{Binding IsLoading}">
                                            <controls:DotSpinner Width="10" Height="10" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                            <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryLoading}" FontSize="11" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <arc:Alert Tone="Danger" Content="{Binding Error}" IsVisible="{Binding HasError}" />

                                        <StackPanel IsVisible="{Binding !IsLoading}">
                                            <StackPanel IsVisible="{Binding !HasError}">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryNoChanges}" FontSize="11"
                                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}"
                                                           IsVisible="{Binding !HasFiles}" />
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Files}">
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:GitFileViewModel">
                                                    <StackPanel Margin="0,0,0,2">
                                                        <Button Theme="{StaticResource TKCode.RowButton}" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                                                HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch" Padding="6,5"
                                                                Command="{Binding ToggleExpandedCommand}">
                                                            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,Auto,*,Auto">
                                                                <icons:LucideIcon Kind="ChevronRight" Width="11" Height="11" Margin="0,0,6,0"
                                                                                  VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                                  StrokeBrush="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}"
                                                                                  motion:Turn.IsOn="{Binding IsExpanded}" />
                                                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Width="16" Height="16" Margin="0,0,6,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                                    <icons:FileTypeIcon Kind="{Binding Icon}" ColorKey="{Binding IconColor}"
                                                                                        Width="14" Height="14"
                                                                                        HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                                                </Border>
                                                                <Grid Grid.Column="2" ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="12" MaxLines="1"
                                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextPrimary}"
                                                                               TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Directory}" FontSize="11" Margin="6,0,0,0"
                                                                               MaxLines="1" TextTrimming="PrefixCharacterEllipsis"
                                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}" />
                                                                </Grid>
                                                                <StackPanel Grid.Column="3" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                                                            VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" IsVisible="{Binding !IsBinary}">
                                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding AddedText}" FontSize="11"
                                                                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.Success}" />
                                                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding RemovedText}" FontSize="11"
                                                                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.Danger}" />
                                                                    </StackPanel>
                                                                    <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryBinary}" FontSize="11"
                                                                               Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}"
                                                                               IsVisible="{Binding IsBinary}" />
                                                                </StackPanel>
                                                            </Grid>
                                                        </Button>

                                                        <StackPanel IsVisible="{Binding IsExpanded}" Margin="20,2,0,4" Spacing="4">
                                                            <views:DiffView Lines="{Binding Lines}" MaxContentHeight="0" Margin="4,2,0,4"
                                                                            IsVisible="{Binding HasLines}" />
                                                            <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryRenameOnly}" FontSize="11"
                                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="{Binding IsRenameOnly}"
                                                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                                                            <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryDiffTruncated}" FontSize="11"
                                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="{Binding IsDiffTruncated}"
                                                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextTertiary}" />
                                                            <arc:Alert Tone="Danger" Content="{Binding Error}" IsVisible="{Binding HasError}" />
                                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" IsVisible="{Binding IsLoading}">
                                                                <controls:DotSpinner Width="10" Height="10" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                                                <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryLoading}" FontSize="11"
                                                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                                                            </StackPanel>
                                                        </StackPanel>
                                                    </StackPanel>
                                                </DataTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </DataTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl>

                    <Button Theme="{StaticResource TKCode.RowButton}" MinHeight="28" Margin="0,6,0,0"
                            Command="{Binding LoadMoreCommand}" IsVisible="{Binding HasMore}"
                            IsEnabled="{Binding !IsLoadingMore}">
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
                            <controls:DotSpinner Width="10" Height="10" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                 IsVisible="{Binding IsLoadingMore}" />
                            <TextBlock Text="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryLoadMore}" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource TKCode.TextSecondary}" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Button>
                </StackPanel>
            </arc:ScrollArea>

            <!-- 空状态：不是仓库 / 当前分支没有提交 -->
            <arc:EmptyState Icon="{lucide:LucideGeometry Kind=History}"
                            Description="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryNoRepository}"
                            HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsVisible="{Binding HasNoRepository}" />
            <arc:EmptyState Icon="{lucide:LucideGeometry Kind=History}"
                            Description="{loc:TKCodeLangResource HistoryNoCommits}"
                            HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsVisible="{Binding IsEmpty}" />
        </Panel>
    </DockPanel>
</UserControl>
